ort answer","section":"Calculator-assumed","types":["Calculator-assumed"],"calculatorMode":"assumed","responseTypes":["Short answer"],"marks":2,"marksOrigin":"Practice allocation; no printed question marks in source","topics":["Statistics and data"],"subtopics":["Frequency tables"],"mixed":false,"text":"Complete a table of frequency and score × frequency for scores 1 to 8.","hash":"46c919932b18d65335ccbf3d6b367096a1e6a74c87c719b59549c2c0e204d77a","sourceFile":"Data Interpretation Test.docx","sourcePage":3,"sourceKeyFile":"Answers 9 10 Data.pdf","sourceKeyPage":8,"bankFile":"practice-studio-mathematics-data-interpretation-data910.json","addedAt":"2026-10-31T01:10:22Z","solutionOrigin":"supplied-key-checked-with-independent-calculation","scsa":{"curriculum":"Western Australian Curriculum Mathematics 2026","strand":"Probability and statistics","subStrand":"Probability and statistics","year":8,"foundation":true,"optional":false,"url":"https://k10outline.scsa.wa.edu.au/__data/assets/pdf_file/0004/1229467/Mathematics_Scope-and-sequence_7-10__For-implementation-in-2026.PDF"},"figures":1,"markingKeyPoints":[],"html":"<figure><img alt=\"Frequency histogram for scores 1 to 8\" src=\"assets/practice-mathematics/data910-b8a441ffa5feaf70.png\"></figure><p>Complete a table of frequency and score × frequency for scores 1 to 8.</p>","answerHtml":"<h3>Worked solution</h3><p>Frequencies: 1,3,5,7,4,3,2,1. Products: 1,6,15,28,20,18,14,8. Totals: Σf = 26; Σfx = 110.</p><h3>Marking guidance</h3><p>Award practice credit for the correct result(s), with a valid method. Equivalent valid methods are accepted.</p><p>Marks are practice allocations; the source did not print a mark allocation for each question.</p>","sourceData":{"1":1,"2":3,"3":5,"4":7,"5":4,"6":3,"7":2,"8":1},"markingMode":"manual","typedAnswers":{"version":1,"fields":[{"label":"Frequencies for scores 1 to 8","kind":"tuple","expected":["1","3","5","7","4","3","2","1"],"tolerance":1e-09},{"label":"Score × frequency for scores 1 