ation for each question.</p>","sourceData":{"1":1,"2":3,"3":5,"4":7,"5":4,"6":3,"7":2,"8":1},"markingMode":"manual","typedAnswers":{"version":1,"fields":[{"label":"Mean (2 dp)","kind":"number","expected":"4.23","tolerance":0.005}],"fullQuestion":true,"scope":"All requested results."}},{"id":"maths-lower-data-910-data-interpretation-short-q8","subject":"Mathematics","area":"Mathematics","year":9,"originalYear":9,"examYear":0,"units":"Lower school","number":8,"sourceNumber":"8","sourceSection":"Short answer","source":"Data Interpretation · Short answer","section":"Calculator-assumed","types":["Calculator-assumed"],"calculatorMode":"assumed","responseTypes":["Short answer"],"marks":1,"marksOrigin":"Practice allocation; no printed question marks in source","topics":["Statistics and data"],"subtopics":["Histograms and frequency polygons"],"mixed":false,"text":"Add a frequency polygon to the histogram.","hash":"0e4f8e32ea0e41f80a41f4194a97457d3731d644710390831f990f90c781b8cc","sourceFile":"Data Interpretation Test.docx","sourcePage":3,"sourceKeyFile":"Answers 9 10 Data.pdf","sourceKeyPage":8,"bankFile":"practice-studio-mathematics-data-interpretation-data910.json","addedAt":"2026-10-31T01:10:22Z","solutionOrigin":"supplied-key-checked-with-independent-calculation","scsa":{"curriculum":"Western Australian Curriculum Mathematics 2026","strand":"Probability and statistics","subStrand":"Probability and statistics","year":9,"foundation":false,"optional":true,"url":"https://k10outline.scsa.wa.edu.au/__data/assets/pdf_file/0004/1229467/Mathematics_Scope-and-sequence_7-10__For-implementation-in-2026.PDF"},"figures":1,"markingKeyPoints":[],"html":"<figure><img alt=\"Frequency histogram for scores 1 to 8\" src=\"assets/practice-mathematics/data910-b8a441ffa5feaf70.png\"></figure><p>Add a frequency polygon to the histogram.</p>","answerHtml":"<h3>Worked solution</h3><p>Join the points (1,1),(2,3),(3,5),(4,7),(5,4),(6,3),(7,2),(8,1) in order with straight segments. If closing the polygon, add (0,0) and (9,0). Use the midpoints of the column tops.</p><h3>Marking guidance</h3><p>Award practice credit for the correct results. Explanations, construction and drawn graphs require teacher review. Equivalent valid methods are accepted.</p><p>Marks are practice allocations; the source did not print a mark allocation for each question.</p>","sourceData":{"1":1,"2":3,"3":5,"4":7,"5":4,"6":3,"7":2,"8":1},"markingMode":"manual"},{"id":"maths-lower-data-910-data-interpretation-short-q9","subject":"Mathematics","area":"Mathematics","year":8,"originalYear":9,"examYear":0,"units":"Lower school","number":9,"sourceNumber":"9","sourceSection":"Short answer","source":"Data Interpretation · Short answer","section":"Calculator-assumed","types":["Calculator-assumed"],"calculatorMode":"assumed","responseTypes":["Short answer"],"marks":1,"marksOrigin":"Practice allocation; no printed question marks in source","topics":["Statistics and data"],"subtopics":["Frequency tables"],"mixed":false,"text":"Complete the cumulative frequency column.","hash":"179f8030aa879669cee9e6b5d6f59b1c197dda74dea2078e6b7c57168bfa5297","sourceFile":"Data Interpretation Test.docx","sourcePage":4,"sourceKeyFile":"Answers 9 10 Data.pdf","sourceKeyPage":9,"bankFile":"practice-studio-mathematics-data-interpretation-data910.json","addedAt":"2026-10-31T01:10:22Z","solutionOrigin":"supplied-key-checked-with-independent-calculation","scsa":{"curriculum":"Western Australian Curriculum Mathematics 2026","strand":"Probability and statistics","subStrand":"Probability and statistics","year":8,"foundation":true,"optional":false,"url":"https://k10outline.scsa.wa.edu.au/__data/assets/pdf_file/0004/1229467/Mathematics_Scope-and-sequence_7-10__For-implementation-in-2026.PDF"},"figures":0,"markingKeyPoints":[],"html":"<table><thead><tr><th>Score</th><th>Frequency</th><th>Cumulative frequency</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>2</td><td>3</td><td>?</td></tr><tr><td>3</td><td>5</td><td>?</td></tr><tr><td>4</td><td>5</td